{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ErO9bDtO7K1789289333.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">簡約公屋兩個屯門項目即將入伙。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">房屋局局長何永賢在社交平台發文，指屯門欣寶路及青發街項目，將會是下一批入伙項目，而副局長戴尚誠早前到青發街辦公室，視察單位編配情況，並與準住戶交流。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LPH-1600_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026NoxipL7ylT1789289495.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LPH-1600_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/>當局形容今年是簡約公屋的「豐收年」，先後有啟德世運道、九龍灣彩石里及柴灣常安街項目已入伙。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T09:00:58.461428+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}